---
// Five questions, native <details> — keyboard-accessible for free.
---

<section class="faq">
  <div class="container faq-inner">
    <p class="ecp">GET /query/apps</p>
    <h2>Questions, answered</h2>

    <details>
      <summary>Does it work with every Roku?</summary>
      <p>
        Any Roku device on your Wi-Fi — streaming sticks, boxes, and Roku TVs.
        Volume and power controls appear automatically when your device is a
        Roku TV.
      </p>
    </details>

    <details>
      <summary>What happens after the 7 days?</summary>
      <p>
        The trial ends and Clicker asks you to buy it — once. Pay one price
        and it’s yours forever, updates included. If you don’t, it stops
        working; no charge ever sneaks through.
      </p>
    </details>

    <details>
      <summary>Do my phone and Roku need the same Wi-Fi?</summary>
      <p>
        Yes. Clicker talks directly to your Roku over your local network —
        that’s what makes it fast and private. It can’t control a Roku over
        the internet, by design.
      </p>
    </details>

    <details>
      <summary>Does it need an account or internet?</summary>
      <p>
        No account, ever. And no internet — just your Wi-Fi. The email you
        leave on this site is only for a beta invite; the app itself never
        asks for anything.
      </p>
    </details>

    <details>
      <summary>How does the beta work?</summary>
      <p>
        Leave your email above. Invites go out through Apple’s TestFlight in
        small batches; when a spot opens you’ll get a link to install the
        beta free.
      </p>
    </details>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .faq { padding-block: calc(var(--space) * 4) calc(var(--space) * 12); }

  .faq-inner { max-width: 720px; }

  .faq h2 {
    margin-top: calc(var(--space) * 3);
    margin-bottom: calc(var(--space) * 5);
  }

  details {
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    padding-block: calc(var(--space) * 2.5);
  }

  details:first-of-type { border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }

  summary {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-stretch: 108%;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 18px;
    cursor: pointer;
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    gap: calc(var(--space) * 2);
  }

  summary::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }

  summary::after {
    content: "+";
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 20px;
    color: var(--teal-deep);
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  details[open] summary::after { content: "–"; }

  details p {
    margin-top: calc(var(--space) * 1.5);
    max-width: 56ch;
  }
</style>
